  "d28: 🍽️ Oliver counts the pantry jars twice, then sets down the gathering sack. \"We're eating well. Sharpening the skinning knives instead.\"",
  "d28: 🍽️ Diana watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""
 ],
